        <tr><td>Refund policy</td><td>"No Quibble Refunds," no explanation needed</td><td>Standard, case-by-case</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Support channel</td><td>WhatsApp, email, help centre</td><td>WhatsApp (proactive follow-up, confirmed first-hand)</td></tr>
